{"seq":3,"slug":"cte-and-recursive","title":"CTE 与递归查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/cte-and-recursive","wordCount":721,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"cte-与递归查询\">CTE 与递归查询</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>公共表表达式（CTE, Common Table Expression）使用 WITH 子句定义临时命名的结果集，在后续查询中引用。CTE 提升了 SQL 的可读性和模块化程度，将复杂查询分解为逻辑清晰的步骤。递归 CTE 是处理层级数据（如组织架构、分类树、图遍历）的标准工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CTE 类型] --&gt; B[普通 CTE]&#10;    A --&gt; C[递归 CTE]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[可读性提升]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[避免重复子查询]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[逻辑分层]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[锚点成员 - 初始集]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[递归成员 - 迭代扩展]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[终止条件]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 执行模型&#10;        D[CTE 定义] --&gt; E{是否递归?}&#10;        E --&gt;|否| F[物化或内联]&#10;        E --&gt;|是| G[迭代执行直到空集]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[CTE 类型] --&gt; B[普通 CTE]\n    A --&gt; C[递归 CTE]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[可读性提升]\n    B --&gt; B2[避免重复子查询]\n    B --&gt; B3[逻辑分层]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[锚点成员 - 初始集]\n    C --&gt; C2[递归成员 - 迭代扩展]\n    C --&gt; C3[终止条件]\n\n    subgraph 执行模型\n        D[CTE 定义] --&gt; E{是否递归?}\n        E --&gt;|否| F[物化或内联]\n        E --&gt;|是| G[迭代执行直到空集]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CTE 特性</th>\n<th>普通 CTE</th>\n<th>递归 CTE</th>\n<th>派生表（子查询）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法</td>\n<td>WITH name AS (...)</td>\n<td>WITH RECURSIVE name AS (...)</td>\n<td>FROM (...) AS name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可多次引用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是（自引用）</td>\n<td>否（每次重新执行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物化行为</td>\n<td>数据库决定</td>\n<td>必须迭代执行</td>\n<td>通常内联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>复杂查询分层</td>\n<td>树/图遍历</td>\n<td>简单派生</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"普通-cte\">普通 CTE</h2><p>普通 CTE 将复杂查询拆分为逻辑单元，每个 CTE 可以引用前面定义的 CTE，形成数据处理流水线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const basicCTE = `&#10;-- 多步数据处理流水线&#10;WITH monthly_sales AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date) AS month,&#10;        SUM(amount) AS total_amount,&#10;        COUNT(*) AS order_count&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    WHERE order_date &gt;= &#39;2024-01-01&#39;&#10;    GROUP BY user_id, DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date)&#10;),&#10;user_tiers AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        user_id,&#10;        AVG(total_amount) AS avg_monthly_spend,&#10;        CASE &#10;            WHEN AVG(total_amount) &gt;= 10000 THEN &#39;platinum&#39;&#10;            WHEN AVG(total_amount) &gt;= 5000 THEN &#39;gold&#39;&#10;            WHEN AVG(total_amount) &gt;= 1000 THEN &#39;silver&#39;&#10;            ELSE &#39;bronze&#39;&#10;        END AS tier&#10;    FROM monthly_sales&#10;    GROUP BY user_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    ut.tier,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS user_count,&#10;    AVG(ut.avg_monthly_spend) AS avg_spend&#10;FROM user_tiers ut&#10;GROUP BY ut.tier&#10;ORDER BY avg_spend DESC;&#10;&#10;-- CTE 引用链&#10;WITH raw_data AS (&#10;    SELECT * FROM events WHERE event_date = CURRENT_DATE&#10;),&#10;aggregated AS (&#10;    SELECT event_type, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM raw_data GROUP BY event_type&#10;),&#10;ranked AS (&#10;    SELECT *, RANK() OVER (ORDER BY cnt DESC) AS rnk FROM aggregated&#10;)&#10;SELECT * FROM ranked WHERE rnk &lt;= 10;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> basicCTE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多步数据处理流水线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH monthly_sales AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        DATE_TRUNC('month', order_date) AS month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        SUM(amount) AS total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        COUNT(*) AS order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE order_date >= '2024-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id, DATE_TRUNC('month', order_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user_tiers AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        AVG(total_amount) AS avg_monthly_spend,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        CASE </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WHEN AVG(total_amount) >= 10000 THEN 'platinum'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WHEN AVG(total_amount) >= 5000 THEN 'gold'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            WHEN AVG(total_amount) >= 1000 THEN 'silver'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            ELSE 'bronze'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        END AS tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM monthly_sales</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ut.tier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS user_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(ut.avg_monthly_spend) AS avg_spend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM user_tiers ut</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY ut.tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY avg_spend DESC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- CTE 引用链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH raw_data AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT * FROM events WHERE event_date = CURRENT_DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aggregated AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT event_type, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM raw_data GROUP BY event_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ranked AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT *, RANK() OVER (ORDER BY cnt DESC) AS rnk FROM aggregated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM ranked WHERE rnk &#x3C;= 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CTE 的物化（Materialization）行为因数据库而异。PostgreSQL 12+ 默认内联非递归 CTE（等价于子查询），可以用 <code>MATERIALIZED</code> / <code>NOT MATERIALIZED</code> 显式控制。MySQL 8.0 总是物化 CTE。</p>\n<h2 id=\"递归-cte\">递归 CTE</h2><p>递归 CTE 由两部分组成：锚点成员（Anchor Member，初始数据集）和递归成员（Recursive Member，迭代扩展规则）。每次迭代将递归成员的结果与之前的结果合并，直到递归成员返回空集。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const recursiveCTE = `&#10;-- 组织架构树展开&#10;WITH RECURSIVE org_tree AS (&#10;    -- 锚点：顶级节点（没有上级的员工）&#10;    SELECT &#10;        employee_id, &#10;        employee_name, &#10;        manager_id, &#10;        1 AS depth,&#10;        employee_name::TEXT AS path&#10;    FROM employees&#10;    WHERE manager_id IS NULL&#10;    &#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    &#10;    -- 递归：连接子节点&#10;    SELECT &#10;        e.employee_id, &#10;        e.employee_name, &#10;        e.manager_id, &#10;        t.depth + 1,&#10;        t.path || &#39; &gt; &#39; || e.employee_name&#10;    FROM employees e&#10;    INNER JOIN org_tree t ON e.manager_id = t.employee_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT * FROM org_tree ORDER BY path;&#10;&#10;-- 分类树遍历（包含子孙计数）&#10;WITH RECURSIVE category_tree AS (&#10;    SELECT category_id, parent_id, name, 0 AS level&#10;    FROM categories WHERE parent_id IS NULL&#10;    &#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    &#10;    SELECT c.category_id, c.parent_id, c.name, ct.level + 1&#10;    FROM categories c&#10;    INNER JOIN category_tree ct ON c.parent_id = ct.category_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT &#10;    REPEAT(&#39;  &#39;, level) || name AS display_name,&#10;    category_id,&#10;    level&#10;FROM category_tree&#10;ORDER BY category_id;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> recursiveCTE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 组织架构树展开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH RECURSIVE org_tree AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    -- 锚点：顶级节点（没有上级的员工）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        employee_id, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        employee_name, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        manager_id, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        1 AS depth,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        employee_name::TEXT AS path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE manager_id IS NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    -- 递归：连接子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        e.employee_id, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        e.employee_name, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        e.manager_id, </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        t.depth + 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        t.path || ' > ' || e.employee_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM employees e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INNER JOIN org_tree t ON e.manager_id = t.employee_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM org_tree ORDER BY path;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 分类树遍历（包含子孙计数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH RECURSIVE category_tree AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT category_id, parent_id, name, 0 AS level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM categories WHERE parent_id IS NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT c.category_id, c.parent_id, c.name, ct.level + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM categories c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INNER JOIN category_tree ct ON c.parent_id = ct.category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    REPEAT('  ', level) || name AS display_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    category_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM category_tree</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY category_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>递归 CTE 的安全防护至关重要。无限递归会耗尽资源，必须设置深度限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防护措施</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>适用数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>深度限制</td>\n<td>WHERE depth &lt; 100</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行数限制</td>\n<td>FETCH FIRST 1000 ROWS</td>\n<td>SQL 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行时间限制</td>\n<td>SET statement_timeout</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CYCLE 检测</td>\n<td>CYCLE column SET cycle_mark</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 14+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"递归查询实战模式\">递归查询实战模式</h2><p>递归 CTE 不仅用于树遍历，还能解决日期序列生成、图路径查找、层级聚合等问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const recursivePatterns = `&#10;-- 日期序列生成（无需 generate_series）&#10;WITH RECURSIVE dates AS (&#10;    SELECT DATE &#39;2024-01-01&#39; AS dt&#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    SELECT dt + INTERVAL &#39;1 day&#39;&#10;    FROM dates&#10;    WHERE dt &lt; DATE &#39;2024-12-31&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT dt FROM dates;&#10;&#10;-- 图最短路径（BFS）&#10;WITH RECURSIVE shortest_path AS (&#10;    SELECT &#10;        node_id AS target,&#10;        ARRAY[start_node, node_id] AS path,&#10;        1 AS distance&#10;    FROM edges&#10;    WHERE start_node = 1&#10;    &#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    &#10;    SELECT &#10;        e.node_id,&#10;        sp.path || e.node_id,&#10;        sp.distance + 1&#10;    FROM edges e&#10;    INNER JOIN shortest_path sp ON e.start_node = sp.target&#10;    WHERE e.node_id &lt;&gt; ALL(sp.path)&#10;      AND sp.distance &lt; 10&#10;)&#10;SELECT DISTINCT ON (target) target, path, distance&#10;FROM shortest_path&#10;ORDER BY target, distance;&#10;&#10;-- 层级聚合（求子树下所有节点的总销售额）&#10;WITH RECURSIVE subtree AS (&#10;    SELECT category_id FROM categories WHERE category_id = 5&#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    SELECT c.category_id&#10;    FROM categories c&#10;    INNER JOIN subtree s ON c.parent_id = s.category_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT SUM(p.sales_amount) AS total_sales&#10;FROM products p&#10;WHERE p.category_id IN (SELECT category_id FROM subtree);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> recursivePatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 日期序列生成（无需 generate_series）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH RECURSIVE dates AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT DATE '2024-01-01' AS dt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT dt + INTERVAL '1 day'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM dates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE dt &#x3C; DATE '2024-12-31'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT dt FROM dates;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 图最短路径（BFS）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH RECURSIVE shortest_path AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        node_id AS target,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ARRAY[start_node, node_id] AS path,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        1 AS distance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM edges</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE start_node = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        e.node_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        sp.path || e.node_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        sp.distance + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM edges e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INNER JOIN shortest_path sp ON e.start_node = sp.target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE e.node_id &#x3C;> ALL(sp.path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      AND sp.distance &#x3C; 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT DISTINCT ON (target) target, path, distance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM shortest_path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY target, distance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 层级聚合（求子树下所有节点的总销售额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH RECURSIVE subtree AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT category_id FROM categories WHERE category_id = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT c.category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM categories c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INNER JOIN subtree s ON c.parent_id = s.category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT SUM(p.sales_amount) AS total_sales</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE p.category_id IN (SELECT category_id FROM subtree);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"cte-与性能权衡\">CTE 与性能权衡</h2><p>CTE 的性能影响取决于数据库的优化策略和查询复杂度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const ctePerformance = `&#10;-- PostgreSQL 12+：NOT MATERIALIZED 让优化器内联 CTE&#10;WITH active_users AS NOT MATERIALIZED (&#10;    SELECT user_id FROM users WHERE status = 1&#10;)&#10;SELECT * FROM orders o&#10;WHERE o.user_id IN (SELECT user_id FROM active_users);&#10;&#10;-- MATERIALIZED 强制物化（当 CTE 被多次引用时有用）&#10;WITH user_stats AS MATERIALIZED (&#10;    SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS cnt, SUM(amount) AS total&#10;    FROM orders GROUP BY user_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT * FROM user_stats WHERE cnt &gt; 10&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT * FROM user_stats WHERE total &gt; 50000;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ctePerformance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- PostgreSQL 12+：NOT MATERIALIZED 让优化器内联 CTE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH active_users AS NOT MATERIALIZED (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id FROM users WHERE status = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.user_id IN (SELECT user_id FROM active_users);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- MATERIALIZED 强制物化（当 CTE 被多次引用时有用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH user_stats AS MATERIALIZED (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS cnt, SUM(amount) AS total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM user_stats WHERE cnt > 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM user_stats WHERE total > 50000;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CTE 只被引用一次</td>\n<td>NOT MATERIALIZED</td>\n<td>允许优化器将过滤条件下推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTE 被引用多次</td>\n<td>MATERIALIZED</td>\n<td>避免重复执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归 CTE</td>\n<td>自动物化</td>\n<td>递归必须迭代执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简单过滤 CTE</td>\n<td>用子查询替代</td>\n<td>减少优化器分析开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CTE 使用 WITH 子句定义临时命名结果集，将复杂查询分解为逻辑清晰的步骤</li>\n<li>普通 CTE 可以链式引用，形成数据处理流水线，提升可读性和维护性</li>\n<li>递归 CTE 由锚点成员和递归成员组成，用于树遍历、图路径、日期生成等场景</li>\n<li>递归查询必须设置深度限制和终止条件，防止无限递归耗尽资源</li>\n<li>CTE 物化行为因数据库而异，PostgreSQL 12+ 支持 MATERIALIZED / NOT MATERIALIZED 显式控制</li>\n<li>性能权衡：单次引用优先内联，多次引用优先物化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CTE 与递归查询","id":"cte-与递归查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"普通 CTE","id":"普通-cte"},{"level":2,"text":"递归 CTE","id":"递归-cte"},{"level":2,"text":"递归查询实战模式","id":"递归查询实战模式"},{"level":2,"text":"CTE 与性能权衡","id":"cte-与性能权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/window-functions"},"next":{"title":"集合操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/set-operations"}}